title: "SSaN Isfahan Pilot: Spatial Social Agent Network"
abstract: "An analytical digital twin of Isfahan Municipality District 6. The pilot proves the SSaN architecture using open data, H3 spatial grids, graph neural networks, and gravity-based agent movement."
